# Magicite (Bastok 4-1) at status 2, the stones set by a GM one by one: _6r9 with one stone or two of the three: the
# mission's 138 (1), then (the alternation) _6r9's own 138; Aldo with any stone: 183; the three stones and the Airship
# Pass: _6r9 60 (1, 0), whose finish takes the stones, gives 20000 gil, the title and status 3.
lists RuludeGardens/_6r2/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Goggehn/onTrigger RuludeGardens/_6r9/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/129 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/128 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/60 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/35 LowerJeuno/Aldo/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Muckvix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/152 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/184 UpperJeuno/Geebeh/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Paya-Sabya/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/80 AltarRoom/Magicite/onTrigger AltarRoom/onZoneIn/1 AltarRoom/onEventFinish/44 AltarRoom/onEventFinish/10000 MonasticCavern/Magicite/onTrigger MonasticCavern/onEventFinish/0 QulunDome/Magicite/onTrigger QulunDome/onEventFinish/0
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=3,9,-76 job=WAR lvl=50 nation=1
